{%- comment -%}
  Built-in default mega menu with the full Subhan Fitness category hierarchy.
  Renders immediately on install (no Shopify Navigation setup required).
  Links point at /collections/<handle>; if a collection doesn't exist yet the
  link still renders and resolves once the collection is created.
  To switch to a fully admin-managed menu, set Header → "Menu source" to
  "Shopify Navigation".
{%- endcomment -%}
